# Credential and connection files. vps1.md names the production host and user
# (the deploy scripts read both); connect.md is the reader-role guide. Neither
# belongs in history. This directory is not a git repository today -- the rule
# exists so that a `git init` here can never turn a local file into commit
# history, which deletion does not undo. altspotter was the only service
# without one.
vps.md
vps1.md
connect.md
*.env
.env*
*.creds

# Build output
build/
compile_commands.json

# Local scratch
*.log
*.tmp
